              "rotation": 0,
              "zIndex": 17,
              "visible": true
            },
            "small": {
              "x": 6.256410256410255,
              "y": 3202.023,
              "width": 88,
              "rotation": 0,
              "zIndex": 17,
              "visible": true
            }
          },
          "font": "mono"
        },
        {
          "id": "text-mqaffyx0",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. (ᵔ◡ᵔ) One of several convenience store snacks that got devoured. The price, taste, and ease of it all was just as everyone had said. Salmon onigiri, 10/10\n\n3. (・ω・) Had to try a maid cafe. My bear curry smiled at me as I ate his face off. Didn't expect much taste-wise, but the maids were fun and the presentation cute. 7/10\n\n4.(⌒▽⌒)☆ Cold soba. Always a treat, especially in the hot weather, 8.5/10",
          "tone": "caption",
          "fontSize": {
            "large": 18,
            "medium": 18,
